","x":"So caustic raw-material price increases are never particularly welcome.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/01/18/alcoa-aa-q4-2017-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2017 Q4","e":"aa","d":"2018-01-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Oplinger","x":"In the quarter, the net loss attributable to Alcoa Corporation was $196 million or $1.06 per share, primarily due to restructuring costs associated with the resolution of the Rockdale Energy contract and the announced closure of the Rockdale operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/01/18/alcoa-aa-q4-2017-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2017 Q4","e":"aa","d":"2018-01-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Oplinger","x":"Out of the $391 million, $297 million is restructuring comprised of the Rockdale contract termination, Rockdale plant closure, and take-or-pay energy contracts that curtailed smelters, less a reversal of a reserve for an Italian power matter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/01/18/alcoa-aa-q4-2017-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q1","e":"aa","d":"2018-04-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roy Harvey","x":"As I mentioned earlier, we're seeing a confluence of events in our markets, U.S. government imposed sanctions impacting the entire aluminum value chain, tariffs affecting aluminum and supply disruptions in alumina.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/19/alcoa-aa-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q1","e":"aa","d":"2018-04-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roy Harvey","x":"Starting with a series of U.S. government actions that include Section 232 tariffs, Section 301 tariffs and the recently announced sanctions on Russia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/19/alcoa-aa-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q1","e":"aa","d":"2018-04-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roy Harvey","x":"Neither incorporate price increases from this week.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/19/alcoa-aa-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q1","e":"aa","d":"2018-04-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roy Harvey","x":"Fourth, based on current market prices, we've raised our outlook for full-year adjusted EBITDA, excluding special items, to $3.5 billion to $3.7 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/19/alcoa-aa-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2018-07-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Oplinger","x":"One new and recurring unfavorable impact is tariffs on our imports into the U.S., mostly from our Canadian smelters, which you see in the other category.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/19/alcoa-aa-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2018-07-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Oplinger","x":"Starting in June at $15 million in the month, we expect a $14 million negative monthly impact as long as tariffs are in place, reducing some of the benefit we would otherwise see from the higher Midwest premium.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/19/alcoa-aa-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2018-07-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Oplinger","x":"Taking a look at items not related to price indices, fixed price contracts and other contract pricing in our Alumina segment were a $30 million offset to the higher API prices impacting price/mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/19/alcoa-aa-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2018-07-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Oplinger","x":"Alumina adjusted EBITDA improved $246 million, primarily due to higher alumina index prices with offsets from unfavorable price/mix and lower volume and other cost pressures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/19/alcoa-aa-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2018-07-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roy Harvey","x":"While this is up 38% sequentially, there were trade actions and operational factors that affected the quarter, which also play into our lower 2018 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/19/alcoa-aa-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2018-07-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roy Harvey","x":"And lastly, as I alluded to earlier, due to current market prices, trade actions and operational factors, we are reducing our 2018 outlook to a range between $3.0 billion to $3.2 billion, down from $3.5 billion to $3.7 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/19/alcoa-aa-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2018-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William Oplinger","x":"And the sequential impact of a full quarter of section 232 tariffs is $19 million and is included in other.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/17/alcoa-corporation-aa-q3-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2018-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William Oplinger","x":"While we paid tariffs mostly on Canadian production, it's not the entire section 232 tariff story.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/17/alcoa-corporation-aa-q3-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"AA 2018 Q4","e":"aa","d":"2019-01-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William F. Oplinger","x":"Of the $138 million of restructuring before tax and noncontrolling interests, $107 million was to establish an allowance on Brazil state VAT 