,"r":"analyst","s":"David Gagliano","x":"And then just the other clarification I had was during your remarks I thought I heard you mention a $12 million -- I thought you said $12 million tariff benefit that flowed through in the fourth quarter or did I misunderstand that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/21/alcoa-corporation-aa-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2020 Q4","e":"aa","d":"2021-01-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William F. Oplinger","x":"For the full year, revenues declined $1.1 billion to $9.3 billion on lower alumina and aluminum prices, while the net loss attributable to Alcoa improved $955 million to $170 million primarily due to lower restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/21/alcoa-corporation-aa-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2020 Q4","e":"aa","d":"2021-01-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roy C. Harvey","x":"It was fully implemented in 2020 and has brought cost saving and improved operational and commercial performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/21/alcoa-corporation-aa-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q1","e":"aa","d":"2021-04-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roy C. Harvey","x":"Some provinces are preventing the launch of new energy-intensive industrial projects, including primary aluminum smelting in order to meet their targets, and others are canceling preferential power tariffs for smelters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q1","e":"aa","d":"2021-04-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roy C. Harvey","x":"And Gansu canceled preferential smelter power tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q1","e":"aa","d":"2021-04-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roy C. Harvey","x":"And even through the midst of the pandemic, we've also been able to move forward and work on our portfolio restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q1","e":"aa","d":"2021-04-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William F. Oplinger","x":"And so, in a market that's got good strong tailwinds to be able to make the tons as stably, as predictably and as safely as we have been doing and also deliver on cost savings, just a tremendous amount of credit goes to our operations team and our operations around the world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2021-07-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roy C. Harvey","x":"Finally, in Gansu this year, we have noted that the province canceled preferential power tariffs for primary aluminum smelters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2021-07-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Roy C. Harvey","x":"And so that tends to, as you see, even those price increases happening inside of China, it tends to incentivize less imports.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2021-10-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William F. Oplinger","x":"Working capital has increased in line with expectations, as metal prices continue to rise and now are being joined by Alumina price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2021-10-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William F. Oplinger","x":"The good news, though, Alex is that, we pass through the majority of that impacts on to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2021 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2021-10-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roy C. Harvey","x":"…that in the external market, or whether we use it to move very quickly inside, to retrofit, or to build that next smelter, and it very much depends on what's happening in the broader market, of course, but also, on us meeting the commitments around cost savings and capital cost efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/15/alcoa-corporation-aa-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2025-07-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Molly Beerman","x":"While the Midwest premium increased during the quarter in response to the increase in U.S. tariffs, the increase was more than fully offset by lower LME, resulting in a decrease in the realized price of aluminum.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/17/alcoa-aa-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2025-07-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Molly Beerman","x":"The sequential decrease in adjusted EBITDA of $542 million is primarily due to lower alumina and aluminum prices and increased U.S. Section 232 tariff costs on aluminum imported into the U.S. from our Canadian smelters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/17/alcoa-aa-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2025-07-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"William Oplinger","x":"We're able to pass through 90 of that through a higher Midwest premium.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/17/alcoa-aa-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2025-07-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"William Oplinger","x":"And if you assume that they can pass that on to their customers, then I guess the net neutral to them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/17/alcoa-aa-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q2","e":"aa","d":"2025-07-17","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Molly Beerman","x":"Third, we are increasing our outlook for interest expense to $180 million from our prior estimate of $165 million due to unfavorable value-added tax assessments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/17/alcoa-aa-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2025-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Oplinger","x":"We've not seen those available yet for long-term packages in the U.S. In fact, the opposite of that is occurring because some of the data centers and the AI centers are able to pay $100 a megawatt hour, whereas we're looking for $30 to $40.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/alcoa-aa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2025-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Oplinger","x":"What we do have opportunities in Massena East is around data centers and AI, and there is electrical infrastructure still in place, and we're looking at opportunities there along with everywhere else in North America, but we're really looking at opportunities at Massena East.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/alcoa-aa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2025-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William Oplinger","x":"With increases in the Midwest premium this quarter, related revenue on our U.S.-produced tons more than offset the net unfavorable tariff impacts on imports of aluminum to the U.S. from our Canadian smelters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/alcoa-aa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2025-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William Oplinger","x":"The recent rise in the Midwest premium is now sufficient to cover the full cost of logistics for importing aluminum into the U.S., including the 50% Section 232 tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/alcoa-aa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2025-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Molly Beerman","x":"…$786 million gain on the sale of our interest in the Ma'aden joint venture and a subsequent favorable mark-to-market change of $267 million on the Ma'aden shares, partially offset by restructuring and related charges of $895 million for the permanent closure of the Kwinana refinery in Australia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/alcoa-aa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q3","e":"aa","d":"2025-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Oplinger","x":"As I look at opportunities for improvement, Brazil now has to get the stability and take the cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/alcoa-aa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q4","e":"aa","d":"2026-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Molly Beerman","x":"These impacts were partially offset by increased tariff costs based on higher LME and higher production costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/alcoa-aa-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q4","e":"aa","d":"2026-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"William Oplinger","x":"Foundry demand, however, remains challenged as tariffs pressure auto OEM profitability and supply chains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/alcoa-aa-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AA 2025 Q4","e":"aa","d":"2026-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Molly Beerman","x":"We do not provide guidance on full-year cash restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/22/alcoa-aa-q4-2025-earnings-cal